WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.600
SCP-096 Vs a Fighter Jet: Who would win?

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.560
There’s actually some precedent&nbsp;
for this. During the infamous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.040
containment breach engineered by Dr. Dan&nbsp;
that resulted in a huge number of deaths,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.960
multiple jets were dispatched to take down&nbsp;
SCP-096, or at least slow its violent advance.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:22.560
We learned that the weapons of a fighter jet&nbsp;
have no meaningful effect against SCP-096,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.080
and will offer no meaningful&nbsp;
protection against its attacks, either.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:31.760
A jet will eventually need to land and refuel.&nbsp;
096 will never tire until it destroys its target,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.960
and will attack and kill the&nbsp;
pilot as soon as the jet lands.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:36.880
Savage.

